# Shell scripts in this repository are copied into Linux containers and executed
# there, so they must keep LF endings whatever the host's git is configured to do.
# Without this, a clone on Windows (git's default core.autocrlf=true) rewrites
# entrypoint.sh / app-entrypoint.sh with CRLF and the containers fail to start.
# Normalising everything keeps configs shipped into the images consistent too.
* text=auto eol=lf
